---
layout: base.njk
title: Publish with us
description: Herbart Kita publishes books by writers before college, gap year included. Publishing is free for authors, and you keep your copyright.
permalink: /publish/
---
{% from "macros.njk" import cover %}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Publish with us</p>
    <h1 class="display display--page">You don’t have to wait until college to publish a book.</h1>
    <p class="lede">We only publish writers who haven’t started college. If you’re in middle school, in high school, or taking a gap year, you can send us your work. It costs you nothing.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <h2 class="section-label">Who can submit</h2>
    <ul class="checks">
      <li>Students in middle school or high school</li>
      <li>Gap year students who haven’t enrolled in college yet</li>
      <li>Writers under 18 need a parent or guardian to sign with them</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-label">How a book gets made</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <p class="step__num">1</p>
        <h3>Send your manuscript</h3>
        <p>Send the full draft, or a sample and a short description of the book. Tell us your school year so we know you’re eligible.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <p class="step__num">2</p>
        <h3>Editing</h3>
        <p>An editor works through the manuscript with you, first the big questions of structure, then line by line.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <p class="step__num">3</p>
        <h3>Design and production</h3>
        <p>We lay out the interior, design the cover, and check the print proofs with you before anything goes out.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <p class="step__num">4</p>
        <h3>Release</h3>
        <p>Your book goes on sale on Amazon and in print, with your name on the cover.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="terms">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-label">What it costs, what you keep</h2>
    <div class="terms">
      <article class="term term--lead">
        <p class="term__big">Free</p>
        <p>Authors never pay us. Editing, cover design, layout, and publishing cost you nothing.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="term">
        <h3>You keep the copyright</h3>
        <p>Your book is copyrighted in your name, and your name is on its copyright page.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="term">
        <h3>We publish it for three years</h3>
        <p>You give us the exclusive right to publish your book in print and as an ebook for three years from its release. After that it continues until either of us chooses to end it.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="term">
        <h3>Other rights stay yours</h3>
        <p>Audiobook, translation, film, and TV rights belong to you. We don’t take a share of them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="term">
        <h3>You can take it back</h3>
        <p>If your book goes off sale, ask and we’ll return your publishing rights.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="term">
        <h3>A parent signs too</h3>
        <p>Writers under 18 sign the publishing agreement together with a parent or guardian.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band__head">
      <h2 class="section-label">Books we’ve published</h2>
      <a class="more" href="/books/">See them all</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="strip">
      {% for b in books %}<li><a href="/books/#{{ b.author | slugify }}">{{ cover(b) }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--tint" id="submit">
  <div class="wrap cta">
    <div>
      <h2 class="cta__title">Ready to send something?</h2>
      {% if site.email %}
      <p>Email your manuscript or sample to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Manuscript%20submission">{{ site.email }}</a>. Put your name, school year, and the book’s title in the message.</p>
      {% else %}
      <p>Our submissions address is on its way. Check back soon.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if site.email %}<a class="btn btn--solid" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Manuscript%20submission">Email a manuscript</a>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
